  unitName: Death Idol Kikuri
  unitId: 60175
  unitNumber: 487
  description: A dancing girl who came from another world. During the tumultuous
    battle with the gods, blood flowed throughout her battlefield. As the elegance
    and strength of her dancing increased, more and more humans lost their lives,
    and the battlefield soon became sparse. Continuously spouting her discontent,
    she came across someone on the battlefield. Though she would come to fight alongside
    this person, it is said she saw her not as an ally, but as her potential prey.
  summonDesc: I will reduce all of your <br>enemies to a bloodbath.<br>That's what
    you want, right?
  fusionDesc: I just love how rich and<br>prosperous you seem.<br>Share your wealth
    with me?
  evoDesc: I'm pretty in red, don't you think?<br>Hehe, I could be even prettier<br>if
    you gave me more blood, though.
  element: 6
  rarity: 5
